{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/KVTAcm8Kzsbze-QGllO6UQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:15.917014+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/KVTAcm8Kzsbze-QGllO6UQ","html":"<div><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/sia5TdXfTytL6JD9Q6KOficVyNN0zWFILhjTgIia4UVOsFP9I97ofMZNWyVVtlGTNE058yARpXPicHh4Aic40Nussbg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>为增进全国各院校优秀本科生对我院学科专业、导师的了解，搭建全国优秀医学本科生交流平台，我院将于2026年7月22-23日举办全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营活动，欢迎全国各大高校符合条件的优秀学子踊跃报名。现将相关通知如下：</span></span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/F0EDib1icpDmfQMV78lyRZSWCyXZNAPPeUb5icX9yKENia8h9SJG5B1vBM8ENibicSZ416chPtWTy5ujggy00bGEZ0LFcsaZc9o86TdgSkaA7sPrU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><strong><span>一、医院简介</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>安徽医科大学第四临床医学院（第四附属医院）坐落在美丽的巢湖之滨，2006年3月被评为三级甲等医院。2012年12月，医院被省政府批准为安徽医科大学直属附属医院。2013年1月，医院正式移交安徽医科大学管理，更名为安徽医科大学附属巢湖医院。2025年3月，经安徽省卫健委批复同意，医院更名为安徽医科大学第四附属医院。<span>经过七十多年的建设和发展，已成为一家集医疗、教学、科研、预防、保健、康复等功能为一体的三级甲等省管综合性医院。</span></span></span></p><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/F0EDib1icpDmeoJHlUACPWBdDxu2kfLqBmzsxNDGR4RxI1G2icX1X9GInNodGU5nv43icw0Hae0p4jRPicNMBqXtHttBVdzhNQEic5lKWhnxqvUvg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><p><span><span>医院现有省临床重点专科5个，国家住院医师规范化培训基地专业基地13个，2025年入选省级博士后科研工作站。近年来，医院获国家自然科学基金14项，省级以上科研项目73项，省自然科学奖三等奖1项、省科技进步二等奖1项、三等奖2项，国际发明专利1项，国家发明专利3项，实用新型专利14项，安徽省卫生适宜技术推广项目3项，发表高水平卓越论文400余篇，2篇论文被纳入联合国可持续发展目标。医院现有科研顾问1人，博士生导师16人，硕士生导师70人。</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/F0EDib1icpDmdQjdx4nfHzaicuPlf9yHWfMibudfu0nEAA36CaWDcqIHMkkEkXicc8PjsZoVxvTxF9fPzdWq3Pf3kxFLOoJtibhrFSaO7Fsnc4Ijc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/F0EDib1icpDmecAm5Apb1DNC9YNcc9vHOibT3UtrIZAohQEuRWUTgKIbXfPMKay3aM1rBJsnVPCQGriaSaIqLJUia0HiaY2nicSMLObZcuibboibU6nI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/F0EDib1icpDmdL85iabbIKOBUWeuWPsibadzE4icWfIPJSOIbVqLjY036Bdf4vVFBcxVb5ZyuzW13nqUeybgfE8JDOyc6XR49FVHkKwROGztoCpw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/F0EDib1icpDmcvO4WVvLGRSgfUicjpK5LiaPiaGqlZUokKTdIIoqm0sia71URWSqxmLgGeysb9scldiaIbkXXckj30DzibO5bibPIcrSYksVG7AiaOdv0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><strong><span>二、报名时间</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>即日起—7月13日17:00</span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/F0EDib1icpDmeQdLbt68lLib57MQjIJlwBKfs0K569XnONofobL9eiarIG5wr43rg1y5909za17zIpRAl3ooujNSicIQxicPxg2AYyHIPgeJibicAgs/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><strong><span>三、</span></strong><span><strong><span>计划营员人数</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>本次夏令营活动计划营员人数20-30名，实际入营人数将根据情况适当调整。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/F0EDib1icpDmeQPly9vnibeiaahTO3o1L4nDetnwF0PajjheTM7lCiaES2icPukaiaQc4x4pOHfTMIcSiamealshY5BGAhYqUb3lMCQfSticMBXlKwvU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><strong><span>四、</span></strong><span><strong><span>夏令营活动安排</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>本次夏令营活动将于7月22日—23日在安徽医科大学第四临床医学院（第四附属医院）（巢湖市巢湖北路64号）举行，初步日程安排如下：</span></span></p><p><span><span>（一）7月22日下午：营员报到；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（二）7月23日上午：开营仪式，院情、学科、招生及奖助政策介绍，导师团队面对面，学生座谈会；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（三）7月23日下午：参观院实验室，临床技能培训中心，结营仪式。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/F0EDib1icpDmdcwNKibvDoiaicQoqDuTtdUb4nUGv8IXu0HvnTicHwjmvfBNoOQkqicQUGa1Uib1iajhsuBlfkYiceL8xRI69IrtFu9YCMhdgEpNhia0yk/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><strong><span>五、申请条件</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>（一）普通高校全日制本科2027届应届毕业生，且有意报考我院2027年硕士研究生的同学；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（二）拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为社会主义现代化建设服务，品德良好，遵纪守法；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（三）学习成绩优异，具有浓厚科研兴趣，有较强的研究能力；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（四）专业成绩排名和综合素质排名均在本专业名列前茅。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/F0EDib1icpDmdqaZboLID2DyHrRcGU0SYCbHHpUiauOrCuhcoAZua5iaCeeKzWSQXaIXOibHBYXFUQMEtbFtIV9Wxib3gaHAQ3nW2lMDUOv2IYp9U/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><strong><span>六、申请程序</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>（一）材料清单</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>1.《安徽医科大学第四临床医学院（第四附属医院）2026年全国优秀大学生夏令营申请表》（见附件1）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.身份证、学生证扫描件；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.现有本科阶段成绩单和专业排名证明（需显示截止目前所有课程成绩、且需有教务部门或学院盖章）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.外语水平证明，如（CET四级、CET六级、雅思、托福、专业外语成绩等）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.其他证明材料（各种荣誉、科研经历、社会实践等）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>6.安徽医科大学第四临床医学院（第四附属医院）2026年优秀大学生夏令营汇总表（见附件2）。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>（二）报名方式</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>请将材料1-5按照材料顺序扫描成一个PDF文件，与材料6一起，于</span><strong><span>2026年7月13日前</span></strong><span>发送至邮箱:1809445878@qq.com，逾期不再接收。邮件命名方式：夏令营+本科学校+意向专业+姓名。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>（三）夏令营资格审定</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>医院学生工作部审核并确定夏令营入营人员名单，审核通过者会有电话通知，并加入夏令营微信群，未入选者，不另行通知。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>（四）优惠政策</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span><span>夏令营表现优异者报考2027年安徽医科大学第四临床医学院（第四附属医院）硕士研究生，且达到报考专业初试和复试相关要求，同等条件下可优先拟录取。</span></span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/F0EDib1icpDmdPw8ZP10RVIbHIynNp8N1yOtt7OL3XVzrJibxibrCGxibLxT4rdAxatMJWwx1ficI9NaAUmOlibN80HJrUGKJY1vbtjvyMWzsRJTSg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><strong><span>七、注意事项</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>（一）本次夏令营活动不收取任何费用，医院为入选营员提供活动期间食宿，交通费自理。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（二）夏令营各项事宜，如有变化，将及时在安徽医科大学第四临床医学院（第四附属医院）网站发布，敬请关注。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/F0EDib1icpDmdURBJMvibV2Zt2b3Ngdy03zhPcPeWVbEIYJibId5LRkNden5VFgQk0qc52ok7T3hTNibotj8GnkoZWv0ukaUpo0uM9NRiaicMc6g60/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><strong><span>八、联系方式</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>联系人：季老师 方老师</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系电话：0551-82326610</span></span></p><p><span><span>mail:1809445878@qq.com</span></span></p><p><span><span>地址：安徽省合肥市巢湖市巢湖北路64号安徽医科大学第四临床医学院（第四附属医院）学生工作部</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><p><span><span><span> </span></span><span><span>热忱欢迎全国高校2027届优秀本科毕业生参加安徽医科大学第四临床医学院（第四附属医院）优秀大学生暑期夏令营活动！</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/KVTAcm8Kzsbze-QGllO6UQ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>附件1安徽医科大学第四临床医学院第四附属医院2026年优秀大学生夏令营申请表.docx</span></a></span></span></p><p><span><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/KVTAcm8Kzsbze-QGllO6UQ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>附件2安徽医科大学第四临床医学院第四附属医院2026年优秀大学生夏令营汇总表.docx</span></a></span></span></p></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><strong><span>END</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/F0EDib1icpDmdZ6ozRv5xic68Mic55ce0zQAjRyC1Bukypvs2BztViadKIbP6JnxE9fa6wg1kNoNzVZicjVJ8LxWIJj5bYuIMJUFBAxON8NZIF3EM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"7093eca005c31fdf36cf38cd6957e6dcf8be51570fa020259931a1db091315c3","textLength":1742,"sourceSha256":"c0335b437eb1228029141202760a4c53c8a99021932159ac4e0d797e5c8c1e47","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-d68db0d566fbc099c463","title":"2026年安徽医科大学第四临床医学院（第四附属医院）2026年全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营招生通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:15.917014+00:00"}
